By the way, the upgrade worked smoothly on my two packages that follow the RStudio way.  They passed Travis and `devtools::build_win`. (The two packages are https://github.com/OuhscBbmc/REDCapR/tree/RefClassTry & https://github.com/wibeasley/Wats.)

